.SH NAME
as_graph \- Convert the inferred network into a graph model, so that it can be exported as a
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIas_graph(\fBnet\fR as <generic> AracneNetwork);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Convert the inferred network into a graph model, so that it can be exported as a
 network file or be visualized by the \fBigraph\fR package.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBnet\fB \fR\- the network that is created via the \fBaracne\fR api. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a [NetworkGraph](cref:T:Microsoft.VisualBasic.Data.visualize.Network.Graph.NetworkGraph) object: the nodes are the genes of the network, the
 edges carry the \fBinteraction_type\fR (\fBdirected\fR/\fBmutual\fR/\fBundirected\fR),
 the \fBprior\fR flag and the \fBregulation\fR type (\fBactivator\fR/\fBinhibitor\fR) metadata.
.PP
